<section class="sec"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="betanote">
    <h2 class="bt">Honest note: rewynd is in beta</h2>
    <p>Builds are currently unsigned, so Windows may warn on first run ("More info", then "Run anyway"), a downloaded .pkg on macOS needs right-click → Open the first time (the one-liner installer skips that), and macOS asks for screen-recording permission again after updates. Code signing is being set up. If something breaks, it's built in the open: <a href="https://github.com/gankedtv/rewynd/issues">report it on GitHub</a> and you'll talk to the person who made it.</p>
  </div>
</div></section>
